    9: introduction x
    9.2: apply_backward_step has_real_derivative_sub
    9.2: apply_backward_step has_real_derivative_rmul_atreal
    9.2: apply_fact @3,9.1
    9.3: apply_backward_step conjD1 @9.2
    9.5: apply_backward_step has_real_derivative_rmul_atreal
    9.5: apply_backward_step conjD2 @9.2
